{"id":"n28163-1-7","stage":2,"title":"코트 · 球场","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28163-1-7-1","ko":"너 여기 멍이 들었네. 어쩌다 그랬어?","zh":"你这里有淤青啊。是怎么弄成的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"멍이","meaning":"青块，淤青","explanation":"멍：青块，淤青；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"멍","audio":"/audio/bd9899a4316fe5ab25a2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54990","senseId":"1","lemma":"멍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들었네.","meaning":"进入，陷入","explanation":"들다：进入，陷入；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"10","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어쩌다","meaning":"指“什么”、“怎么”。","explanation":"어쩌다：指“什么”、“怎么”。","readings":[{"term":"어쩌다","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29765","senseId":"2","lemma":"어쩌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그랬어?","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"bd9899a4316fe5ab","term":"멍","zh":"青块，淤青","audio":"/audio/bd9899a4316fe5ab25a2.mp3","entryId":"54990","definition":"由于挨碰或挨打，皮下出现淤血的现象。","pronunciation":["멍"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"进入，陷入","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"处于某种处境或变成某种状态。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"85a8c2b5d5fccc03","term":"어쩌다","zh":"指“什么”、“怎么”。","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3","entryId":"29765","definition":"指“什么”、“怎么”。","pronunciation":["어쩌다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/fc6fc3960eac8acbd3db.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28163-1-7-2","ko":"테니스 코트를 지나가다가 공에 맞았어.","zh":"路过网球场时被球打到了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"테니스","meaning":"网球","explanation":"테니스：网球","readings":[{"term":"테니스","audio":"/audio/aa5ded493982a07e5a3d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37605","senseId":"1","lemma":"테니스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"코트를","meaning":"球场","explanation":"코트：球场；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"코트","audio":"/audio/e4ebe27790116d0febd5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28163","senseId":"1","lemma":"코트","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지나가다가","meaning":"通过，路过","explanation":"지나가다：通过，路过；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"지나가다","audio":"/audio/9c25392f9bf0bb82799e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60216","senseId":"1","lemma":"지나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공에","meaning":"球","explanation":"공：球；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"공","audio":"/audio/396159745e203d0de79f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19496","senseId":"1","lemma":"공","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맞았어.","meaning":"打中，被打中","explanation":"맞다：打中，被打中；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66233","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"aa5ded493982a07e","term":"테니스","zh":"网球","audio":"/audio/aa5ded493982a07e5a3d.mp3","entryId":"37605","definition":"中间挂一道网，双方各据一边，用拍子来回打球而比胜负的运动比赛。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"e4ebe27790116d0f","term":"코트","zh":"球场","audio":"/audio/e4ebe27790116d0febd5.mp3","entryId":"28163","definition":"供网球、篮球、排球等竞技比赛使用的场地。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"9c25392f9bf0bb82","term":"지나가다","zh":"通过，路过","audio":"/audio/9c25392f9bf0bb82799e.mp3","entryId":"60216","definition":"经过某个地方。","pronunciation":["지나가다"]},{"id":"396159745e203d0d","term":"공","zh":"球","audio":"/audio/396159745e203d0de79f.mp3","entryId":"19496","definition":"用于运动或游戏的圆球形物体，大小适合手玩或脚玩。","pronunciation":["공ː"]},{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"打中，被打中","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66233","definition":"射出或扔出的物体碰触到其它物体上；或被使得碰触到其它物体。","pronunciation":["맏따"]}],"audio":"/audio/f634d8aad895d7ef5380.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.402,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28163","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":81,"sequenceScore":2.2287,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["路过网球场时被球打到了。","你这里有淤青啊。是怎么弄成的？","谁来负责整理这些资料？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你这里有淤青啊。是怎么弄成的？","谁来负责整理这些资料？","路过网球场时被球打到了。"],"answer":2}]}
